# Optional. Only needed if this deployment's real domain differs from the
# default hardcoded in lib/site.ts (https://savemorewithcoupons.com) — e.g. a
# staging environment. Used to build canonical URLs, Open Graph tags and the
# sitemap. Copy this file to .env and uncomment to override:

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://savemorewithcoupons.com
